      457.72
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this orderimpose in respect of list of commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, a Special Commodity Levy at the ratesspecified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule. This Order shall be valid for a period of 03 monthscommencing from 01st July 2017, subject to provisions of Sub section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity LevyAct, No. 48 of 2007.",
